            ^"Category" STRING "Animal"
            ^"Combat Conflict Rank" INTEGER 3
            ^"Intrigue Conflict Rank" INTEGER 1
            ^"Description" STRING "Untamed feral horses roaming the steppes and deserts beyond Rokugan. Shorter and stockier than domesticated breeds, with strong fight-or-flight instincts."
